+
+# Frozen Attention003 on larger BI-V150 models
+
+The exact stage31 candidate is reused without retuning. Native and control preserve the default compiled SwiGLU, native RMSNorm and vendor causal fused softmax=True. Control is CE0008+gradnorm001; only Attention003 is added in the optimized arm. Stage31 instead includes SwiGLU004 in its control, so its13.96% gain cannot be transferred to these models.
+
+## Complete independent rounds
+
+### wide
+
+4L H512 FFN2048 S256 V4096 batch2; 21107200 parameters; masked_softmax_fusion=True; native compiled SwiGLU
+
+| Seed | Native ms/step | CE+gradnorm ms/step | +Attention003 ms/step |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+|32102|34.02|31.77|31.90|
+|32103|34.61|32.57|31.17|
+|32104|34.27|32.59|30.91|
+
+Decision: `not_promoted`.
+
+- Attention increment over same-round CE+gradnorm control: +3.1409%; all seeds faster: False.
+- Combined CE+gradnorm+Attention over same-round native: +9.4984%; all seeds faster: True.
+- controlled: 1475 checks/637 tensors, bitwise equal=True.
+- native_optimized: 1475 checks/637 tensors, bitwise equal=True.
+- native_control: 1475 checks/637 tensors, bitwise equal=True.
+- Complete local original raw numerical snapshots:42; missing:0. Backup inventory:48 files.
+
+### deep
+
+8L H512 FFN2048 S512 V8192 batch2; 42213888 parameters; masked_softmax_fusion=True; native compiled SwiGLU
+
+| Seed | Native ms/step | CE+gradnorm ms/step | +Attention003 ms/step |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+|32202|65.43|61.81|60.33|
+|32203|64.27|61.83|60.21|
+|32204|65.24|64.48|59.60|
+
+Decision: `promoted_tested_model_only`.
+
+- Attention increment over same-round CE+gradnorm control: +4.4107%; all seeds faster: True.
+- Combined CE+gradnorm+Attention over same-round native: +8.2141%; all seeds faster: True.
+- controlled: 2371 checks/1165 tensors, bitwise equal=True.
+- native_optimized: 2371 checks/1165 tensors, bitwise equal=True.
+- native_control: 2371 checks/1165 tensors, bitwise equal=True.
+- Complete local original raw numerical snapshots:42; missing:0. Backup inventory:48 files.
+
+## Measurement and reuse rules
+
+Three independent seeds, three rotated fresh-process arms per seed,120 steps per arm, first20 excluded; ten retained interval10 means. Primary timing is the unchanged Megatron GPU-synchronized time.time loop. No profiling/audit/checkpoint/evaluation/large backups during timing. Promotion requires strictly >1% geometric throughput versus the same-round control and every seed faster. The independent22-case/2-guard probe uses CUDA Events only as a separate microbenchmark.
+
+Correctness is a separate three-update audit, including identical initial weights/batches, per-token loss, all FP32 main_grad tensors, BF16 model parameters and FP32 SGD masters. CPU float64 tolerances remain atol3e-4/rtol1e-3. All three comparisons are bitwise equal in each shape. CPU archive verification rechecks original receipt statistics and SHA256 of locally retained bytes; it does not replay GPU arithmetic.
+
+The new Pod required restoration of exact pinned source blobs and the original dataset Makefile, then compilation with existing vendor pybind11. The initial missing-Makefile audit and missing-pybind11 build failures are retained as startup failures. No model/candidate/precision/timer gate was changed. The original600-source manifest and a separate before/after proof for the Makefile/helpers.cpp/compiled data helper are bound in CPU verification. These receipts do not seal every installed runtime binary.
+
+This validates only single BI-V150 mock-data GPT, BF16 intermediates and FP32 gradients/SGD masters, TP/PP/CP1 and dropout0. It does not establish production training, convergence, AdamW, multiGPU, FlashAttention, NVIDIA TMEM/TMA/tcgen05/WGMMA/NVFP4 equivalence or H100/B200 performance.
+
+## Pinned backend snippet
+
+```python
+import torch
+from megatron.core.fusions.fused_softmax import ScaledUpperTriangMaskedSoftmax
+# Set S=256 or512 for the declared BF16 causal backend.
+S = 512
+scores = torch.randn(16, S, S, device="cuda", dtype=torch.bfloat16, requires_grad=True)
+probs = ScaledUpperTriangMaskedSoftmax.apply(scores, 1.0)
+grad = torch.autograd.grad(probs, scores, torch.randn_like(probs))[0]
+assert grad.shape == scores.shape and grad.dtype == scores.dtype
+```
